      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST A SAPPHIRE (2) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 42.35. Fair draw can see a good run and has the ability and in winning form. One of the key runners again. OUR GIRL JESS (6) doesn't have the best strike-rate. Finished in the money last time though when second (42.40) at this track. Form here sound including 12 wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and six minor placings to her name from nine starts. Expected to feature. CASHING OUT (1) has missed the frame at his last couple but did finish in the minors in quick time three back (42.24) at this track in a Grade 5. Well placed here and can atone this time. BLAME HER (4) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
